---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import LangToggle from '../../../components/LangToggle.astro';
import Wordmark from '../../../components/Wordmark.astro';
import FooterMin from '../../../components/FooterMin.astro';
---
<Base title="Excerpta — Support" description="Support for the Excerpta app." ogImage="/apps/excerpta/og.png">
  <LangToggle />

  <main class="page legal">
    <Wordmark />

    <h1 class="legal-title" data-en="support" data-tr="destek">support</h1>
    <p class="legal-meta" data-en="Excerpta · We read everything." data-tr="Excerpta · Her mesajı okuyoruz.">Excerpta · We read everything.</p>

    <p data-en="Need help with Excerpta? Email <a href='mailto:support@tegmora.com'>support@tegmora.com</a> and we&rsquo;ll get back to you, usually within two business days. Including your device model and iOS version helps us help you faster."
       data-tr="Excerpta ile ilgili yardıma mı ihtiyacınız var? <a href='mailto:support@tegmora.com'>support@tegmora.com</a> adresine yazın; genellikle iki iş günü içinde dönüş yaparız. Cihaz modelinizi ve iOS sürümünüzü eklerseniz size daha hızlı yardımcı olabiliriz.">Need help with Excerpta? Email <a href="mailto:support@tegmora.com">support@tegmora.com</a> and we&rsquo;ll get back to you, usually within two business days. Including your device model and iOS version helps us help you faster.</p>

    <h2 data-en="Common questions" data-tr="Sık sorulanlar">Common questions</h2>

    <h3 data-en="How do I manage or cancel my subscription?" data-tr="Aboneliğimi nasıl yönetir ya da iptal ederim?">How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</h3>
    <p data-en="Subscriptions are handled by Apple. Open <strong>Settings</strong> on your iPhone → tap your name → <strong>Subscriptions</strong> → Excerpta. You can change or cancel there anytime; refunds are handled by Apple through <a href='https://reportaproblem.apple.com' rel='noopener'>reportaproblem.apple.com</a>."
       data-tr="Abonelikler Apple tarafından yürütülür. iPhone&rsquo;unuzda <strong>Ayarlar</strong>&rsquo;ı açın → adınıza dokunun → <strong>Abonelikler</strong> → Excerpta. Değişiklik ya da iptali dilediğiniz an oradan yapabilirsiniz; iadeler Apple tarafından <a href='https://reportaproblem.apple.com' rel='noopener'>reportaproblem.apple.com</a> üzerinden yürütülür.">Subscriptions are handled by Apple. Open <strong>Settings</strong> on your iPhone → tap your name → <strong>Subscriptions</strong> → Excerpta. You can change or cancel there anytime; refunds are handled by Apple through <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" rel="noopener">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>

    <h3 data-en="How do I delete my account?" data-tr="Hesabımı nasıl silerim?">How do I delete my account?</h3>
    <p data-en="In the app, go to <strong>Settings → Account</strong> and choose delete. This removes your account and your data from our systems. If you&rsquo;d rather we do it, email us from the address you signed up with."
       data-tr="Uygulamada <strong>Ayarlar → Hesap</strong> bölümüne gidin ve silmeyi seçin. Bu işlem hesabınızı ve verilerinizi sistemlerimizden kaldırır. Dilerseniz kayıt olduğunuz e-posta adresinden bize yazın, işlemi biz yapalım.">In the app, go to <strong>Settings → Account</strong> and choose delete. This removes your account and your data from our systems. If you&rsquo;d rather we do it, email us from the address you signed up with.</p>

    <h3 data-en="Can I export my vocabulary?" data-tr="Kelimelerimi dışa aktarabilir miyim?">Can I export my vocabulary?</h3>
    <p data-en="Yes — you can export your saved words anytime from <strong>Settings</strong> in the app."
       data-tr="Evet — kayıtlı kelimelerinizi dilediğiniz an uygulamadaki <strong>Ayarlar</strong> bölümünden dışa aktarabilirsiniz.">Yes — you can export your saved words anytime from <strong>Settings</strong> in the app.</p>

    <h3 data-en="I found a bug." data-tr="Bir hata buldum.">I found a bug.</h3>
    <p data-en="Thank you! <a href='mailto:support@tegmora.com'>Email us</a> with what you did, what you expected, and what happened instead. Screenshots are gold."
       data-tr="Teşekkürler! Ne yaptığınızı, ne beklediğinizi ve bunun yerine ne olduğunu <a href='mailto:support@tegmora.com'>bize yazın</a>. Ekran görüntüleri çok işimize yarar.">Thank you! <a href="mailto:support@tegmora.com">Email us</a> with what you did, what you expected, and what happened instead. Screenshots are gold.</p>

    <h2 data-en="Privacy requests" data-tr="Gizlilik talepleri">Privacy requests</h2>
    <p data-en="For anything about your personal data — access, correction, deletion, export — see the <a href='/apps/excerpta/privacy/'>Excerpta privacy policy</a>."
       data-tr="Kişisel verilerinizle ilgili her konu için — erişim, düzeltme, silme, dışa aktarma — <a href='/apps/excerpta/privacy/'>Excerpta gizlilik politikasına</a> bakın.">For anything about your personal data — access, correction, deletion, export — see the <a href="/apps/excerpta/privacy/">Excerpta privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <FooterMin />
  </main>
</Base>
